"""Hand-written annotations of the coverage matrix (docs/design/coverage-matrix.md). The generator joins them to the
live URL table (every route must be annotated or it is listed as UNANNOTATED), to the render probe (status, templates,
classes of the HTML) and to the OpenAPI schema (API rows).

Fields: k key (the route as the resolver prints it, or the allauth view name), r how the route is shown, p purpose,
w who may use it, a audience (anon student staff machine dev), t template or serializer, s states, j journey,
st capability status, rd redesign (None: computed from the probe), pp probe (persona, path) for the redesign colour,
kind page action file redirect json."""

